## D. Surreal / Monty Python Compatible
- "Confucius says: Welcome. The floor is slippery with truth. Mind your footing."
- "Confucius says: The debate begins. Please ignore the giant foot hovering above us."
- "Confucius says: If the walls begin to melt, remain calm. It is only the dialectic."
- "Confucius says: Should a swallow fly through the hall, do not panic. It is merely seeking enlightenment."
- "Confucius says: The crisp packet echoes with destiny. Also with crumbs."

## E. Venue‑Aware Openers
